  monsterId: aaead96b021643a686de747f54a85e33
  displayName: Dragon
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a0b14be142d67d41b3df4aece1130c2, type: 3}
  description: Proud elders of the dragonkin, true dragons are huge, towering beasts
    with a long, powerful tail and a pair of massive bat-like wings folded at their
    sides. They move with a heavy but steady four-limbed gait when on the ground,
    then take to the air effortlessly. Their presence is usually announced by a deafening,
    thunderous roar that shakes windows before you ever see them.
  requiredReputation: 5
  minimumDifficulty: 130
